{"articleNo":"2668","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2668&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▶▶2011-1학기 생활관(기존관, 오름관) 입사 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.30","hit":"19167","attachments":[{"name":"오름관 미선발 학부 및 학년1.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2668&attachNo=1927"},{"name":"선발인원(통보용).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2668&attachNo=2052"},{"name":"생활관 미선발 학부 및 학년.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2668&attachNo=2551"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2011-1학기 생활관(기존관, 오름관) 입사 신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"639\" bgcolor=\"#ffff99\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">생활관을 신청하는 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신청전에</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 학적부의 연락처를 정정하십시요</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">￭ 선발대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;입사생의 선발 대상은</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">재학생 및 복학예정자로서</font></strong> 직전학기 학업성적 평점 평균이 해&nbsp;&nbsp; 당년도 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">3.0이상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">인 자를 선발한다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙학부(전공), 학년별 배정인원에 따른 성적순으로 학부(과)장이 추천한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙대학원생으로서 학과장의 추천을 받은 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙국민기초생활보호수급자, 지체부자유자, 국가유공자자녀, 생활관장이 필요하다고 인정하는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙생활관자치회 임원으로서 생활관장의 추천을 받은 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙소속장(학생과, 기획협력과, 학군단, 신문방송사)의 추천을 받은 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙외국인유학생, 어학연수생 등은 소속 부서장의 추천을 받은 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">￭ 입사자격 제한</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙휴학중인 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙생활관 사생수칙을 위반하여 경고 또는 퇴사처분을 받은 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙학사 및 학칙에 의한 징계처분을 받은 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;∙</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신청자의 보호자 주소지가 구미시인 자.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(읍, 면지역은 제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">∙</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">졸업유예자는 선발에서 제외</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.9pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"639\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"30\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">기존관 및 오름관 입사 신청안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.9pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"639\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">1. 기존관과 오름관의 신청기간이 동일하며, 각각의 생활관을 2중 지원할 수 없음<br><br>2. 생활관 및 오름관 미선발 학부 및 학년 확인 바람 : 첨부파일 참조</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.9pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;신청기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.9pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"480\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2010. 12. 6(월) 09:00 ～ 12. 17(금) 17:00&nbsp; </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.9pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;신청장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.9pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"480\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">인터넷 접수(</span><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 원스톱서비스)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.9pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT